{"id":"cadre","lemma":"cadre","pos":"noun","rank":2720,"glosses":["frame (of a door or picture)","backbone (of an organization)","box, square (on a printed page)"],"ipa":"/kadʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4f/Fr-cadre.ogg/Fr-cadre.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cadres"},"formAudio":{"cadres":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a0/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-cadres.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le cadre est maintenant au mur.","en":"The picture is on the wall now.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"now, currently"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"wall"}]},{"text":"Nous étions assis face aux cadres.","en":"We sat face to face with executives.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"sat, sat down, seated"},{"g":"face"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Sors du cadre !","en":"Think outside the box.","words":[{"g":"to exit","l":"sortir"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons besoin d'un cadre pour cette photo.","en":"We need a frame for this picture.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"photo"}]},{"text":"Le cadre doit être poncé et verni.","en":"The frame has to be sanded and varnished.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"varnished"}]}]}